  /* THE DECADES AS THE AXIS. On a wide screen, when they fit, one column
     per decade directly under its bars; the tick labels step aside, since
     the columns now name the years. The axis is equal decades from a
     round year, so equal columns line up with the bars exactly. */
  @media (min-width: 48rem) {
